      "beat_id": "B00",
      "act": "ASK",
      "narration_text": "Hi, I am Row-Haan and this video is about how Google Maps works: how it finds you, picks a route, sees traffic, and knows how busy a cafe or a bus will be. I built a small version of each part to see how.",
