    {
      "beat_id": "B06",
      "act": "HOW BUSY",
      "narration_text": "Popular times come from people who opted in, pooled and privacy-protected, and shown only when enough people visit. I counted a quarter of one cafe's visitors and added privacy noise. The bars still matched the real crowd, busiest at one o'clock. A quiet shop had too little data, so it got no chart.",
